    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d8/Sakine_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230606025829\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sakine Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/d/d8/Sakine_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230606025829\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"929\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sakine Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sakine_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>金鱼公主</b> \n</p><p>一位能与海中鱼类交流的女孩，她的游泳技巧和姿态令人赏心悦目，即使她使用水魔法上岸时，她金鱼般附肢摆动的样子也具有独特的美感。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/32/Sakinespc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230607011247\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sakinespc Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/3/32/Sakinespc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230607011247\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"867\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Sakinespc Queen&#39;s blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Sakinespc_Queen%27s_blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820052730\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive par